        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions #20A Classic Elegance 30 Inch Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStunning design 30\" door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of Reed handle with decorative large fancy cone finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis door handle is assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational door pull designs. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions #20A Classic Elegance Door Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 11\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Reed Style Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This  door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 7 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged standard for  Surface Mounting (Screws to the doors face) with #10 x 1-1/2\" screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
